{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-18","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：比例与整数","englishTitle":"If two numbers by multiplying any number make certain numbers, the numbers so produced will have the same ratio as the multipliers.","book":7,"number":18,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.18","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.18/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":18,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-18@raw-c151e53c768f8d5e","contentId":"euclid-7-18","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c151e53c768f8d5efa667bd68cfad3173125c97f9afac0a9feddf9947b2fc1f2","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-18.statement","euclid-7-18.construction.1","euclid-7-18.proof.1","euclid-7-18.proof.2","euclid-7-18.proof.3","euclid-7-18.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-18.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-18","revisionId":"euclid-7-18@raw-c151e53c768f8d5e","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4ce42b54c03766fcb12860a0547f9044b4668f5cd7087f929c24d24dcc5e5bd7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two numbers by multiplying any number make certain numbers, the numbers so produced will have the same ratio as the multipliers."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个数字乘以任何数字得出一定数字,那么如此延长的数字将具有与乘数相同的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-18.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-18","revisionId":"euclid-7-18@raw-c151e53c768f8d5e","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"958a343d0cc5707c4a72943b568b5ec62a84d39fff93f4d9a4aeda1c1652b7d4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let two numbers A, B by multiplying any number C make D, E; I say that, as A is to B, so is D to E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A,B乘以C,D,E;A比B等于D比E；A 与 B 之比等于 D 与 E 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-18.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-18","revisionId":"euclid-7-18@raw-c151e53c768f8d5e","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"17afe925fc0d56d412dcf607ca4abe762c41d8dd298efdd0907266421e37e7c4","citations":["euclid-7-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since A by multiplying C has made D, therefore also C by multiplying A has made D. [[VII. 16](/principles/euclid-7-16)] For the same reason also C by multiplying B has made E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,自A乘以C后,D,A乘以D后,D,A乘以D后,D,B,E,因同样原因,C乘以B后,E。 [[VII. 16](/principles/euclid-7-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-18.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-18","revisionId":"euclid-7-18@raw-c151e53c768f8d5e","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6564e107d24dc92173f786a30eb65fb0c0b11a79b01c7bba64e88b9ba922765c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the number C by multiplying the two numbers A, B has made D, E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,乘以2个数字A,B,C 得出D,E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-18.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-18","revisionId":"euclid-7-18@raw-c151e53c768f8d5e","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"834d11b694152b41efc1debba8d107445554467d9d938803f4f6e66e8fd045b7","citations":["euclid-7-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as A is to B, so is D to E. [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A比B等于D比E；A 与 B 之比等于 D 与 E 之比。 [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-18.source","contentId":"euclid-7-18","revisionId":"euclid-7-18@raw-c151e53c768f8d5e","order":5,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a496051ed78f7f3c348117d7032da10a2e20da101b95aa86564d678b80c2430f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.18/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.18\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-18:euclid-7-16:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-18","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-18.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-16","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.18","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.18/","sourceLabel":"VII. 16"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-7-18:euclid-7-17:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-18","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-18.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-17","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.18","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts